/-- The depth bound `⌈log_3(n-1)⌉ + 1` from Theorem 2, for `n ≥ 3` (so `n - 1 ≥ 2 > 0`
    and the real logarithm `Real.logb 3 (n - 1)` is well-behaved). -/
