otherwise the input is returned unchanged (this branch never occurs for well-formed
networks, see `NetworkComputes`). -/
def AffineLayer.evalSig (T : AffineLayer) (v : Σ m : ℕ, Fin m → ℝ) : Σ m : ℕ, Fin m → ℝ :=
  if h : v.1 = T.inDim then
