namespace Bridge_025_026

/-!
`depthBound` is defined by literally the same formula in both files
(`⌈Real.logb 3 ((n : ℝ) - 1)⌉₊ + 1`), so `depth` is `rfl`.

`cpwl` is **false**: Agent025's `CPWL` requires `f` to agree with one affine
