namespace Bridge_052_053

/-!
## Summary

* `depthBound`: both agents write the *literal same* term
  `⌈Real.logb 3 ((n : ℝ) - 1)⌉₊ + 1`. **PROVED** (by `rfl`).
* `CPWL`: Agent052 uses a genuine polyhedral-subdivision definition (a finite cover of
